Title: unknown citation key, vancouver
Bibliography: refs.bib
Bibliography mode: replace
Bibliography style: vancouver
Resolve citations: true
---

An unknown key is left as written, in every style, with a build warning:
\cite{NoSuchKey}, and \citet{NoSuchKey}. A known key cited with it is still
resolved, \citep{Quine:1948,NoSuchKey}, and a known key alone, \cite{Skyrms:1996}.

